/target
**/*.rs.bk
*.log
.ingest_cache
robocopy_ingest.log
robocopy_ingest_report.json
*.html
graphify-out/cache/
graphify-out/manifest.json
graphify-out/cost.json
graphify-out/.graphify_*
# Only /graphify-out (repo root) is the canonical graph, tracked deliberately (graph.json +
# GRAPH_REPORT.md). A graphify-out/ anywhere else is a stray graph from running `graphify
# extract <subdir>/` instead of `/graphify --update` on the root -- ignore it outright rather
# than let it get committed as a second, divergent graph (see AGENTS.md's Graphify note).
*/graphify-out/
_ops_reports/
scripts/*.local.ps1
scripts/profiles.json
examples/*.local.toml
installer-output/
installer/Output/
